# docker/palace.Dockerfile copies nothing from the build context: everything
# it needs is cloned or installed inside the build. Sending the checkout
# (results/, vendored PDFs, .git) to the daemon would only slow the build.
*
# docker/palace-first-moment.Dockerfile copies exactly one file: the
# diagnostic patch. Nothing else is admitted; the production Dockerfile still
# copies nothing.
!docker/patches/first-moment-diagnostic.patch
